{"text": "The policeman on the beat moved up the avenue impressively. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was his habit, not a show, because there were few people to see him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The time was barely ten oclock at night, but the streets were almost empty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Chilly gusts of wind with a taste of rain had driven people indoors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He tried doors as he walked, twirling his club with many skillful movements. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now and then he looked down the quiet street with a careful eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This was a part of town that went to bed early. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Here and there, a cigar store or an all night lunch counter still had lights on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Most of the doors belonged to shops which had closed hours earlier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the middle of a block, the policeman suddenly slowed down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the doorway of a dark hardware store, a man was leaning with an unlighted cigar in his mouth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is all right, officer, he said quickly, I am just waiting for a friend.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "l", "i", "c", "e", "m", "a", "n", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "a", "t", " ", "m", "o", "v", "e", "d", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "v", "e", "n", "u", "e", " ", "i", "m", "p", "r", "e", "s", "s", "i", "v", "e", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "h", "a", "b", "i", "t", ",", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "a", " ", "s", "h", "o", "w", ",", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "f", "e", "w", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "h", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".